<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>HTTP/1.1 (1999):</stron=
g> ETag introduced for content-based validation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Modern era:</strong> We=
ak vs Strong ETags, sophisticated generation algorithms</li>
</ul>
